        ns1:Hacktivist ;
    rdfs:comment "Anonymous was able to hack a state intermediary agency for Russia's exports/imports of defense-related and dual use products. Anonymous leaked various classified information about Moscow's unmanned aircraft (UAV) plans and tactics, making it available to everyone on the web. Data from a screenshot shared on Twitter showed that Anonymous gained access to the list of the largest exporters and competitors in the UAV industry as well as a technical and commercial offer for the unmanned aerial vehicle \"Orion-E.\""^^xsd:string .

